  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Initial version (forked from EasyBuild.Changelog) ([d27f27c](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/d27f27c305526887186d8606e29f13eab68155c2))\n* Add `--pre-release` CLI options ([5345138](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/53451380e55e1c5b9110080f61e742ebd19fc1e5))\n* Rework commit selection for skip invalid and merge commit + introduce ReleaseMode support (local, pull-request, push) ([2eabba3](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/2eabba300bbfe2a706b5c95d826576764e9b8106))\n* Handle top level error to explicitly say that something went wrong and better colorize the exception ([ef49e98](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/ef49e98bd047c0a0ea39e868be70cbeef1d07aba))\n* Re-order CLI options and add documentation about them ([5477e46](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/5477e46928e08b77e935f8c0acff41b49b4f673e))\n* Remove `config` CLI options as commit triggering a version bump are hardcoded in ReleaseContext.fs ([eef0004](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/eef000469c0e325962bdc56d30fdfa4fc6ee6636))\n* Add command to generate a list of the supported commit ([4c7634d](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/4c7634dba7ee54ed718d4cb64f7cf67d0604011e))\n* Verify Orchestrator requirements and set required configuration if needed ([72ff433](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/72ff4332d2a8e804b2fb48db5e2e08013685f4b0))\n* Restrict supported event for Github Actions ([feff5ef](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/feff5efce324c1030edc6d1ea72b11852b1c2e8f))\n* Set upstream before pushing ([ba6c4c7](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/ba6c4c79c309d7e19c980370da0eecbf6d1648f1))\n* Various improvements ([b5a1250](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/b5a12506227a22c4d04ad2808070f1b7febb2880))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Improve changelog generation by removing a potential source for 2 consecutive empty lines ([67383af](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/67383af0d38466fcf472a3314584a871947863ec))\n* Create only the required labels ([b603f6e](https://github.com/easybuild-org/EasyBuild.ShipIt/commit/b603f6e21de77055a0da5f14d655cd2f4f86705c))",
